src/test/modules/mysql_compat/README

Regression tests for the MySQL-compatible SHOW statements
(SHOW DATABASES, SHOW TABLES) and the USE statement.

The tests live in a dedicated module rather than in the main
src/test/regress suite because SHOW DATABASES reports every connectable
database in the cluster, so its output is only stable in a controlled
cluster.  The pg_upgrade test suite, for example, creates databases
whose names contain nearly every ASCII character, which would break any
fixed expected output in the main suite.
